{"id":"6c7e2c47ec8fa610","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Borel Hierarchy Level","display":"df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level — ZFC Recursive Borel Hierarchy Level","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level — ZFC Recursive Borel Hierarchy Level","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level]]","[[58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level — ZFC Recursive Borel Hierarchy Level"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"154d396d8d0ed575\" href=\"?note=154d396d8d0ed575\" title=\"58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level\">58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"69b5b67f3d7445d9\" href=\"?note=69b5b67f3d7445d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code\">58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,X,c,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(A,X,c,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CK}\">\\(\\mathrm{CK}\\)</span> (Church--Kleene superscript)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S\\)</span> (recursive-Polish-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69b5b67f3d7445d9\" href=\"?note=69b5b67f3d7445d9\" title=\"58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code\">58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveBorelHierarchyLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveBorelHierarchyLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}borel\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveBorelHierarchyLevel}_S(A,X,c,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S(c,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land1\\leq\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\land\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(c)\\lor A\\in\\Pi^0_\\alpha(c)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}borel\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveBorelHierarchyLevel}_S(A,X,c,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S(c,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land1\\leq\\alpha&lt;\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\land\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(c)\\lor A\\in\\Pi^0_\\alpha(c)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The effective Borel rank is a nonzero recursive ordinal, and the classified object is explicitly a subset of the coded recursive Polish space.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level","status":"resolved","id":"154d396d8d0ed575","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-borel-hierarchy-level]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code","status":"resolved","id":"69b5b67f3d7445d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code","status":"resolved","id":"69b5b67f3d7445d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S$ (recursive-Polish-code predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-recursive-polish-code]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A,X,c,\\alpha\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CK}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveBorelHierarchyLevel}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}borel\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}level} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveBorelHierarchyLevel}_S(A,X,c,\\alpha)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePolishCode}_S(c,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land1\\leq\\alpha<\\omega_1^{\\mathrm{CK}}\\land\\bigl(A\\in\\Sigma^0_\\alpha(c)\\lor A\\in\\Pi^0_\\alpha(c)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1272,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level.md|58-df-zfc-recursive-borel-hierarchy-level]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","154d396d8d0ed575","69b5b67f3d7445d9"]}